  "solution": "Given 117 + 16 − 10 × 2 ÷ 2 − 68 + 10 × 5 − 9 = ?\n\nif ‘÷’ and ‘×’ are interchanged and ‘−‘ and ‘+’ are interchanged\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/6c723751cbba9ee609b6fd4237a8873ff8fba0afb873b4eeca9043d2128c27db.png] \n\n117 - 16 + __**10 ÷ 2 **__x 2 + 68 - __**10 ÷ 5**__ + 9 = ?\n\n117 - 16 + __**5**____** __x**__** 2**__ + 68 - 2 + 9 = ?\n\n117 - 16 + 10 + 68 - 2+ 9 = ?\n\n117 + 9 + 10 + 68 - 16 - 2= ?\n\n186.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**",
